格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Make your dsh ready for serious coding. (Tools x Schemas)^REPL. skill://, ctx://, agent://, dvc://, dsh://, IPython REPL, Context as Variables, cross compaction recallable, full context revive. hash-edit, dvc://browser, subagent as a function, workflow as a function.","id":"gh:1336328763","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"better-dsh","slug":"pgmi-builds/better-dsh","topics":["agent-harness","dsh","dsh-bundle","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugins","dsh-rlm-mode","ipython","python-sdk","recursive-language-model","repl","rlm"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Make your dsh ready for serious coding. (Tools x Schemas)^REPL. skill://, ctx://, agent://, dvc://, "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"dsh://, IPython REPL, Context as Variables, cross compaction recallable, full context revive. hash-e"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"dit, dvc://browser, subagent as a function, workflow as a function."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Better Dsh — Dashr"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Dashr** (*/ˈdæʃ.ɚ/*) makes your native `dsh` ready for serious coding."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **$(\\text{Tools} \\times \\text{URL schemas})^{\\text{REPL}}$** - a concise, cognitively frictionless"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" setup delivering maximal capacity.\n- Universal **Tools** - `read`, `write`, `grep`, `glob`.\n- **URL"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" schemas** - `skill://`, `ctx://`, `agent://`, `dvc://`, `dsh://`, an intuitive, unified interface f"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"or runtime resources.\n- **Persistent REPL Kernel** - IPython (compared with the native ephemeral TS "},{"id":"p5s5","text":"REPL).\n- (20+ tools × 5 schemas) ^ REPL free composition = **∞**"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Context as Variables** - full session transcripts are accessible as variables, even cross compac"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"tions.\n- **Full Context Revive** — full-namespace `dill` snapshots save and restore kernel state acr"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ll Context Revive** — full-namespace `dill` snapshots save and restore kernel state across restarts."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## ✨ Other Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Agent swarm as resources** — sub-agents, workflows, and Ralph loops are first-class calls (`suba"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"gent`, `workflow`, `ralph`, `message`).\n- **KeepRecency context compactions** - preserve recent rele"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"vancy. Resets the default 80% compaction threshold to 50% as \"usable\" context max.\n- A simplistic gl"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"obal LLM-endpoint failover, absent in the native build (a safeguard for long-range, unattended tasks"},{"id":"p9s5","text":").\n- keeps the system prompt to ~3–4K tokens.\n- **`dvc://browser`** - browser use ready.\n- All `host"},{"id":"p9s6","text":" plane` wired — you do not even see any difference from your `dsh` UI; it just silently fuels up the"},{"id":"p9s7","text":" `dsh` base.\n- **iOS PWA Ready** - minor UI twists that make the webUI a decent PWA for iOS `Add to "},{"id":"p9s8","text":"- **iOS PWA Ready** - minor UI twists that make the webUI a decent PWA for iOS `Add to Home Screen`."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Recommended Companion Plugin(s)"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- `dsh-better-sidebar`\n- `corti` multi-agent memory plugin"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## ⚡ Quick Install"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## 📚 Inspiration & Attribution"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"`better-dsh` is an open-source plugin for DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`) (MIT). It stands on the shoulders"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" of earlier open-source work:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- **BetterEdit** (`dsh-better-edit`, by Rianico) — the hash-anchored `read` → `edit` → `undo_last_ed"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"it` editing model. Dashr adopts this toolchain (itself a lineage of `pi-hashline-edit` → `pi-hashlin"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"e-edit-lsz` → `dsh-better-edit`) with attribution, and re-wires it natively.\n- **omp-agent** (oh-my-"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"pi, by Can Bölük) — the `dvc://` device framework and its `ast_edit` / `ast_grep` / `browser` / `lsp"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"` devices, adopted under its MIT license.\n- **Prime Agent** (Prime Intellect) — the *Context as Vari"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"ables* paradigm that shapes the persistent-kernel model."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"All upstream dependencies carry their original MIT licenses, recorded in the source tree."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## 📄 License"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"MIT. See LICENSE."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
